620469172.en:
NVM i should not have removed the `for<'a>` from my example in the first place. This works:
```
struct Bool<const B: bool>;
trait True {}
impl True for Bool<true> {}

fn u32_to_usize(x: u32) -> usize
where
    for<'a> Bool<{ size_of::<usize>() >= 4 }>: True,
{
    x as _
}
```

